      "title": "Here's How Much $2,500 in General Mills Stock Could Pay You in Dividends in 2027",
      "summary": "General Mills is executing a multi-year turnaround by rolling back prices to regain market share from store brands. The company froze its quarterly dividend at $0.61 per share to conserve cash for the turnaround effort. A $2,500 investment would yield approximately $178 in annual dividend income in 2027, representing a 7.1% yield at a bargain valuation of 10.1x forward earnings.",
